probe copy[DimA,DimA] = sq[DimA,DimA]
	~	~	QUESTION 1. Does Vensim ACCEPT a variable declared over the same
		subscript range twice, and does a plain copy read all nine cells or
		only a diagonal? |

probe sort[DimA,DimA] = VECTOR SORT ORDER(sq[DimA,DimA], 1)
	~	~	QUESTION 2. If the declaration is accepted, what does a vector
		operation over it sort -- each row independently, or something else? |

probe sum = SUM(sq[DimA!,DimA!])
	~	~	QUESTION 3. Does a reducer over the repeated range sum all nine
		cells or only the three diagonal ones? |

INITIAL TIME  = 0 ~~|
FINAL TIME  = 1 ~~|
TIME STEP  = 1 ~~|
SAVEPER  = TIME STEP ~~|

